    },
    {
      "tag": "h3",
      "text": "At Garden Springs Wellness Center, we are dedicated to providing a nurturing and empowering environment for those seeking mental health treatment. Our facility in Englewood, New Jersey, stands as a testament to our commitment to offering unparalleled care and comfort."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We understand the unique challenges you face, and we have designed our facilities to support your journey towards mental wellness and recovery with compassion, expertise, and a touch of elegance.",
      "runs": [
        {
          "t": "We understand the unique challenges you face, and we have designed our facilities to support your journey towards "
        },
        {
          "t": "mental wellness and recovery",
          "href": "/",
          "b": true
        },
        {
          "t": " with compassion, expertise, and a touch of elegance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Our state-of-the-art treatment center is equipped with the latest technology and amenities to ensure an optimal healing experience. Each element of our facility is designed with your comfort and well-being in mind. From our welcoming reception area to our private counseling rooms and group therapy spaces, we have created an environment that fosters relaxation, safety, and positive transformation."
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "What to Expect At Garden Springs Wellness"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "A Facility Designed with Your Lasting Wellness in Mind"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h4",
      "text": "Aromatherapy"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h4",
      "text": "Mindfulness"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h4",
      "text": "Sand Therapy"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h4",
      "text": "Sound Therapy"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Additional Features & Amenities"
    },
    {
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Restore Your Balance. Transform Your Life."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Welcome to a new era of mental health treatment in New Jersey and beyond at Garden Springs Wellness. We have assembled a team of multidisciplinary professionals to help you live your best life."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "You deserve a future free of trauma, depression and anxiety.",
      "runs": [
        {
          "t": "You deserve a future free of trauma, depression and anxiety",
          "b": true,
          "i": true
        },
        {
          "t": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Let us help you begin your journey today."
    }
